WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.070
The sea turtle glared at Cora and Mo.

2
00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:08.182
"Please, Mr. Turtle," Cora said.

3
00:00:08.183 --> 00:00:12.783
"We need your help."

4
00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:21.405
"There's a hungry shark at the reef!" Mo said.

5
00:00:21.406 --> 00:00:25.257
"What can I do?" the turtle snapped.

6
00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:29.423
"Just go away and leave me alone."

7
00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:32.401
Mo ducked behind Cora.

8
00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:36.219
"Why is he so grumpy?" Mo whispered.

9
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:40.458
The turtle tried to swim away. "Ouch!"

10
00:00:40.459 --> 00:00:43.256
"Oh!" Cora said.

11
00:00:43.257 --> 00:00:45.963
"Something is caught on your fin."

12
00:00:45.964 --> 00:00:49.531
"Grr!" the turtle said.

13
00:00:49.532 --> 00:00:55.879
"That must hurt," Cora said.

14
00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.173
"I can help you."

15
00:00:59.174 --> 00:01:02.446
The turtle didn't say anything.

16
00:01:02.447 --> 00:01:08.257
"What's your name?" Cora asked.

17
00:01:08.258 --> 00:01:14.050
"Walt," the turtle said.

18
00:01:14.051 --> 00:01:16.745
Cora swam closer.

19
00:01:16.746 --> 00:01:22.935
She saw plastic wrapped around Walt's flipper.

20
00:01:22.936 --> 00:01:29.286
Snip! With her beak, Cora cut the plastic.

21
00:01:29.287 --> 00:01:33.213
Walt was free!

22
00:01:33.214 --> 00:01:38.161
"Thank you," he grumbled.

23
00:01:38.162 --> 00:01:43.080
"Will you help us now?" Cora said.

24
00:01:43.081 --> 00:01:56.192
"Sorry, I can't." Walt swam away.

25
00:01:56.193 --> 00:01:59.861
Mo sighed.

26
00:01:59.862 --> 00:02:03.325
"The compass led us to the wrong place."

27
00:02:03.326 --> 00:02:07.314
"Or to the wrong turtle," Cora said.

28
00:02:07.315 --> 00:02:10.684
"Now what?" Mo asked.

29
00:02:10.685 --> 00:02:15.176
Cora stopped to think.

30
00:02:15.177 --> 00:02:21.360
Mo gulped. "Cora . . ."

31
00:02:21.361 --> 00:02:24.195
Something was swimming toward them.

32
00:02:24.196 --> 00:02:27.510
It was the hammerhead!

